    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "The sky was blue over our heads."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "She stayed there over a month."
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He is over fifty."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He has little control over his emotion."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Over the next few days, they got to know the town well."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "They had a disagreement over the best way to do it."
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "All the presents are for you."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "He took some aspirin for his headache."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I am speaking for all workers."
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "He went to his friend for a piece of advice."
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "It's quite warm for January."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "He is not bad for a beginner."
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "He was in prison for 5 years."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "The coffee was too hot for her."
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "You are either for me or against me."
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "For all his wealth, he is a very lonely man."
        }
      ]
    },
